{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d10a000a-1e27-4697-b224-a572b53a5ce4","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the requested changes:\n\n1. **Added Hedera JavaScript SDK** (`@hashgraph/sdk`) to the project via `npm install`.\n2. **Created `.env`** with test values for `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY`, `RECIPIENT_ID`, and `VALID_START`.\n3. **Added `src/transfer.ts`**:\n   - Loads environment variables using `dotenv`.\n   - Constructs a `TransactionId` with a custom valid start timestamp (`Timestamp.fromDate`).\n   - Builds a transfer of **1 hbar** from the operator to the recipient, memo `invoice 42`, targeting node `0.0.3`.\n   - Freezes the transaction with an offline client, signs it with the operator’s private key, and prints the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\n4. Updated `package.json` scripts to run the script with `npx tsx src/transfer.ts` (already present from the initial `npm init`).\n5. Verified the project compiles with `npx tsc --noEmit` (no TypeScript errors).\n\nYou can now run the script locally (offline) with:\n```bash\nnpx tsx src/transfer.ts\n```\nThe output will be the signed transaction bytes in hexadecimal format.\n\nAll changes are within the current workspace and no external services were accessed. See **ANSWER.md** for the full summary.\n","duration_seconds":77.062102,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":20687,"output_tokens":6800,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":203456,"total_tokens":27487}}}
